#~ msgid ""
#~ "<h1>Welcome!</h1>\n"
#~ "<p>There are many media-players around these days, this is true. But what's missing from most players is an interface that doesn't get in your way. How many buttons do you have to press when simply adding media to the playlist? amaroK tries to be a little different, providing a simple drag-and-drop interface that makes playlist handling really easy.</p>\n"
#~ "<p align=\"right\"><i>\"amaroK is seriously super!\"</i> - Uncle Rodney</p>\n"
#~ "<h2>First-run Wizard</h2>\n"
#~ "<p>This wizard will help you setup amaroK in three easy steps. Click <i>Next</i> to begin, or if you do not like wizards, click <i>Skip</i>.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<h1>Welkom</h1>\n"
#~ "<p>Daar is gewis baie media spelers bekikbaar vandag. Wat egter by die meeste spelers kort, is 'n intervlak wat nie in jou pad is nie. By party moet jy selfs 'n hele klomp knoppies druk om net media by die speel lys te voeg! amaroK probeer bietjie anders wees, deur 'n eenvoudige trek-en-laat-val intervlak te verskaf wat speel lys handtering baie vereenvoudig.</p>\n"
#~ "<p align=\"right\">Soos Oom Rodney sê: <i>\"amaroK is seriously super!\"</i></p>\n"
#~ "<h2>Eerste-keer-harloop assistent</h2>\n"
#~ "<p>Hierdie assistent sal jou help om amaroK in drie eenvoudige stappe op te stel. Kliek <i>Volgende</i> om te begin, of as jy nie van assistente hou nie, kliek <i>Gaan verby</i>.</p>"

